# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the real key.
AI_PROVIDER=openai
OPENAI_API_KEY=replace-with-your-key
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.4-mini
# To switch back: AI_PROVIDER=anthropic and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key.
# Optional: try another model locally without touching wrangler.toml (src/models.ts).
# MODEL_READ=claude-sonnet-5-5
# MODEL_VOICE=claude-opus-5-5
